WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:06.720
Game of Bones is one of the lesser-known and
less understood installments in the Game of

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.470
Thrones series.

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:13.929
More than mere pornography, Game of Bones
might actually reveal some deep secrets about

00:00:13.929 --> 00:00:16.590
the world of ice and fire.

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:21.730
Game of Bones begins with Varys and Tyrion
immediately breaking the fourth wall.

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:25.670
“They’re making a porn parody, my lord”
“Of Game of Thrones?”

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:30.630
“Yes, and they’re calling it a Game of
Bones”.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:35.370
Characters in Game of Thrones have never before
exhibited this kind of self-awareness of their

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:37.670
place within a fictional story.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:41.920
If they know this, what else might they reveal?

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:46.850
One of the great enduring mysteries of the
Game of Thrones show is how Podrick is able

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:52.400
to so impress the prostitutes Marei , Genna
and Kayla that they refuse payment after a

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:54.780
session in Littlefinger’s brothel.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:59.270
In the first episode of Game of Bones, we
witness Podrick Payne’s prowess first hand,

00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:03.680
but we also get a glimpse of something even
more significant.

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:08.640
The identity of the woman Podrick has sex
with is unclear at first.

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:13.700
She does have tattoos – which might suggest
a she’s a Volantene slave of some kind , but

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:18.120
one of the woman’s tattoos looks like a
blue rose.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:24.030
Blue roses are consistently associated with
Lyanna Stark, the sister of Ned and mother

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:31.280
of Jon, thought dead, but apparently now alive
in disguise as a King’s Landing prostitute.

00:01:31.280 --> 00:01:36.190
This could have huge implications for the
story of Thrones – like, how will Jon Snow

00:01:36.190 --> 00:01:42.159
react when he finds that his mother is not
only alive, but is fellating Podrick Payne?

00:01:42.159 --> 00:01:46.420
These are the kinds of big questions raised
by Game of Bones.

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:51.890
In Episode 3 of Bones, Daenerys Targaryen
meets with Jorah and Daario – Daario looks

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:56.409
like his Season 3 self, and Jorah doesn’t
look much like Jorah at all.

00:01:56.409 --> 00:02:02.960
But importantly, we get a glimpse of two of
Dany’s dragons, who strangely look suspiciously

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:05.049
like cats.

00:02:05.049 --> 00:02:10.379
Could there be a connection between Dany’s
three dragons and Tommen’s three kittens

00:02:10.379 --> 00:02:13.819
– Ser Pounce, Lady Whiskers, and Boots?

00:02:13.819 --> 00:02:18.620
We know from a previous video that there is
a wealth of evidence connecting Ser Pounce

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:26.310
to the prophecy of Azor Ahai, the hero prophesied
to save the world, and to wake dragons from

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:27.310
stone.

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:32.219
It’s hard to draw firm conclusions here
but clearly the fate of Westeros is deeply

00:02:32.219 --> 00:02:38.530
intertwined with that of Dany’s dragons,
and Tommen’s kittens.

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:43.750
In Episode 4 of Game of Bones, Jon Snow and
Ygritte encounter a white walker, who they

00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:45.510
call a “tight walker”.

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:48.939
But the walker is seen holding a white dildo.

00:02:48.939 --> 00:02:54.290
As it happens, a white dildo also appears
in Book 5 of Game of Thrones – when Jon

00:02:54.290 --> 00:03:00.940
Snow lets wildlings through the Wall, he confiscates
their treasures, including “an ivory phallus”

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:05.249
. How did a white walker get this artefact
if it’s held at Castle Black?

00:03:05.249 --> 00:03:08.019
Have the Others infiltrated the Night’s
Watch?

00:03:08.019 --> 00:03:10.830
Is Dolorous Edd secretly a white walker?

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:13.250
The evidence suggests probably.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:19.450
Finally, in Episode 5 of Game of Bones, we
see that King Joffrey has mysteriously become

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:20.629
a woman.

00:03:20.629 --> 00:03:23.680
And there is a possible textual explanation
for this.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:29.809
In Book 4, Maester Aemon says that “Dragons
are neither male nor female … but now one

00:03:29.809 --> 00:03:34.090
and now the other, as changeable as flame”.

00:03:34.090 --> 00:03:39.129
Dragons change their sex just as Joffrey has
– so the only logical conclusion here is

00:03:39.129 --> 00:03:44.480
that Joffrey Baratheon is literally a fire-breathing
dragon.

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:48.969
So in just five episodes, Game of Bones has
shown us greater revelations than we’ve

00:03:48.969 --> 00:03:52.129
seen in the last five years of Game of Thrones
books.

00:03:52.129 --> 00:03:57.489
Lyanna Stark is alive, dragons are cats, the
white walkers are stealing dildos from the

00:03:57.489 --> 00:04:01.359
Night’s Watch, and Joffrey was a dragon
all along.

00:04:01.359 --> 00:04:05.620
There is clearly a lot to be learned from
the porn parody Game of Bones.

